Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 10:49:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Run saves as owner continuations

Capture mutable player and saved-data state inside its owner domain, then write immutable snapshots through asynchronous I/O. Save commands now complete through a finite region I/O barrier instead of blocking the lifecycle owner or waiting for unrelated future writes.

